{"card_id": "rc04", "scene_id": "rc04_s06", "pipeline": "minicpm5-official", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "max_tokens": 512, "mode": "official", "server_side": "server :8091 flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42；请求只传 temperature=1.0/max_tokens"}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你小时候被貔貅救过，讲讲呗。", "user_text_gt": "你小时候被貔貅救过？讲讲呗。", "assistant_text": "小鹿的经历啊…说起来是件大事。貔貅当年是从虎口把我救出来的，不过后来天庭和它的争端又闹得人烦。我被植入四不相的骨血，脱胎换骨后成了仙——可别忘了，这其实是个玩笑。毕竟，生命这东西，最大的秘密就是“活着”。🦌", "latency_s": 1.146, "assistant_audio": "audio_cloud/rc04_s06_1.mp3", "tts_render": "qwen-audio-3.1-tts-next"}], "latency_s": 1.146}
{"card_id": "rc04", "scene_id": "rc04_s10", "pipeline": "minicpm5-official", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "max_tokens": 512, "mode": "official", "server_side": "server :8091 flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42；请求只传 temperature=1.0/max_tokens"}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你跟皮皮现在关系咋样？", "user_text_gt": "你跟皮皮现在关系咋样？", "assistant_text": "哦，皮皮这神兽啊，最近挺闲的。我虽被你救大，但咱们俩其实没啥深交——你当我是摆地摊的伙计，我也不是谁的专属坐骑。最近搬到了云南深山，开了个鹿人店。想跟你说下，烟袋确实没用了，就不送了。但皮皮要是再找我麻烦，我可得小心点呢～（眯着眼轻叹）", "latency_s": 1.273, "assistant_audio": "audio_cloud/rc04_s10_1.mp3", "tts_render": "qwen-audio-3.1-tts-next"}], "latency_s": 1.273}
